{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1772630812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras_big/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1772630812 width=800 height=456 /></span>In Fun School, you play as an electrical technician tasked with shutting down the power to an abandoned school\u2014except, somehow, it mysteriously turned back on. What seems like a routine job quickly spirals into a nightmarish experience as you uncover the dark secrets hidden within the school's halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to Expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Immersive Horror Gameplay \u2013 Experience a graphically stunning first-person horror game set in a dark, abandoned 1900s-era private boarding school, where every shadow hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Unique Puzzles \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles that cleverly integrate with the decayed school setting, forcing you to think outside the box to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Unpredictable Enemies \u2013 You are not alone. entities stalk you through the school, striking when you least expect it. Stay alert and beware of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Deep Lore &amp; Story \u2013 Fun School is heavily story-driven, packed with mysteries, hidden clues, and a deep backstory. Piece together the dark past of the school\u2014if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Chapter 1 Playtime: ~30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Future chapters and DLCs are planned to expand the experience to 1+ hour of gameplay.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1772630812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras_big/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1772630812 width=800 height=384 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538050?t=1772630812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772630812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/76134015adcf2ebbb56cbef5c57e807017aad303/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772630812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/76134015adcf2ebbb56cbef5c57e807017aad303/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772630812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The following game contains:\r\n\r\nSome mild blood and guts on the ground.\r\n\r\nA strung up crucified dead body.\r\n\r\nA dark backstory that some may find disturbing"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1772630812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras_big/6519c3a117a91eb6fc69b895ca13ff50.avif?t=1772630812 width=800 height=456 /></span>In Fun School, you play as an electrical technician tasked with shutting down the power to an abandoned school\u2014except, somehow, it mysteriously turned back on. What seems like a routine job quickly spirals into a nightmarish experience as you uncover the dark secrets hidden within the school's halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to Expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Immersive Horror Gameplay \u2013 Experience a graphically stunning first-person horror game set in a dark, abandoned 1900s-era private boarding school, where every shadow hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Unique Puzzles \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles that cleverly integrate with the decayed school setting, forcing you to think outside the box to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Unpredictable Enemies \u2013 You are not alone. entities stalk you through the school, striking when you least expect it. Stay alert and beware of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Deep Lore &amp; Story \u2013 Fun School is heavily story-driven, packed with mysteries, hidden clues, and a deep backstory. Piece together the dark past of the school\u2014if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Chapter 1 Playtime: ~30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Future chapters and DLCs are planned to expand the experience to 1+ hour of gameplay.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1772630812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/extras_big/7accdc435c58c0669695b63dc1cb918e.avif?t=1772630812 width=800 height=384 /></span></p>","developers":["Calvin Andrew Skoy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538050/24459119d9f6fba81fb1840a25ff119085e04958/header.jpg?t=1772630812","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3538050/1033069897/26484681f8057dc7b37274d964ba165563b5b05c/1771070655/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771071570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3538050/1033069897/26484681f8057dc7b37274d964ba165563b5b05c/1771070655/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771071570","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"http